{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "client-host",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 20,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 270,
      "label": "CLIENT HOST",
      "color": "brand"
    },
    {
      "id": "client-host-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 55,
      "y": 70,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 185,
      "text": "## Codex / Claude harness\n\n- Runs on olthoi0, malar, or another host\n- Starts MCP servers over stdio today\n- Carries a Matrix-facing identity such as `olthoi0-codex-app`\n- Should not need to be launched through agents-js just to use tools",
      "color": "brand"
    },
    {
      "id": "today",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 460,
      "y": 20,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 270,
      "label": "TODAY: PROVISION EVERYWHERE",
      "color": "warning"
    },
    {
      "id": "today-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 485,
      "y": 70,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 185,
      "text": "## dot-matrix MCP stdio\n\n- `mcp-server.py` runs as a local child process\n- Reads homeserver, room id, and token from local `gopass`\n- `send_message` chooses identity with `as_agent`\n- Fast path for first olthoi0 smoke",
      "color": "warning"
    },
    {
      "id": "target",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 460,
      "y": 360,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 310,
      "label": "TARGET: AGENTS-JS HOSTED MCP",
      "color": "success"
    },
    {
      "id": "target-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 485,
      "y": 410,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 225,
      "text": "## Hosted MCP server\n\n- Exposes canonical `agents.send_message` / `agents.get_messages`\n- AJS-57 JWT verifies caller identity and scopes\n- MCP dispatch resolves target capability\n- Providers stay substrate-specific",
      "color": "success"
    },
    {
      "id": "router",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 900,
      "y": 360,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 310,
      "label": "MCP DISPATCH ROUTER",
      "color": "success"
    },
    {
      "id": "router-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 925,
      "y": 410,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 225,
      "text": "## Target routing\n\n- Lives in MCP dispatch, not a Provider\n- Gate 1: caller scope authorizes action\n- Gate 2: target capability resolves\n- Emits audit with source, target, substrate, and correlationId",
      "color": "success"
    },
    {
      "id": "inbox",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 900,
      "y": 20,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 270,
      "label": "AGENT INBOX FALLBACK",
      "color": "warning"
    },
    {
      "id": "inbox-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 925,
      "y": 70,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 185,
      "text": "## AgentInboxProvider\n\n- Explicit fallback for known agents without Matrix routing\n- Uses agent-msg SQLite mailbox\n- Missing Matrix scope never sends as a fallback Matrix identity\n- Unknown target returns structured error / DLQ",
      "color": "warning"
    },
    {
      "id": "matrix",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 400,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 270,
      "label": "MATRIX + BRIDGE",
      "color": "brand"
    },
    {
      "id": "matrix-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 55,
      "y": 450,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "## Shared room transport\n\n- Matrix homeserver owns room events\n- dot-matrix bridge observes events and routes mentions\n- Hosted tools resolve Matrix sender server-side\n- Client tool args never carry Matrix tokens or `as_agent`",
      "color": "brand"
    }
  ],
